{
  "$comment": "Sentry PHP SDK sends events to the DSN's ingest host. Namespaced functions (`\\Sentry\\captureException($e)`), the hub (`\\Sentry\\SentrySdk::getCurrentHub()->captureException($e)`, or a `Sentry\\State\\HubInterface` injected in Symfony), the Laravel facade (`Sentry\\Laravel\\Facade`, aliased as `\\Sentry`) and `Sentry\\Laravel\\Integration::captureUnhandledException($e)` all end in the envelope endpoint. `\\Sentry\\init()` only configures the client and is not listed.",
